      "name": "apply_patch",
      "line_number": 427,
      "docstring": "Apply a StatePatch and reconcile + validate.\n\nSemantics:\n\n    \u2022 If both existing state[key] and patch.value are dicts,\n      perform shallow merge.\n    \u2022 If both are lists, append.\n    \u2022 Else replace the top-level key with patch.value.",
